3. std::is_same
===============

Checks whether two types are identical.

Syntax

std::is_same<T,U>::value

Example

#include <iostream>
#include <type_traits>

using namespace std;

int main()
{
    cout << is_same<int,int>::value << endl;

    cout << is_same<int,double>::value << endl;
}

Output

1
0

=========================================================
4. std::is_integral
===================

Checks whether a type is an integral type.

Example

cout << is_integral<int>::value << endl;

cout << is_integral<char>::value << endl;

cout << is_integral<double>::value << endl;

Output

1
1
0

