11. std::remove_const
=====================

Removes const qualifier.

Example

using T = remove_const<const int>::type;

Result

T becomes

int

=========================================================
12. std::remove_reference
=========================

Removes reference.

Example

using T = remove_reference<int&>::type;

Result

int

=========================================================
13. std::remove_pointer
=======================

Removes pointer.

Example

