22. Common Mistakes
===================

❌ Forgetting to include

#include <type_traits>

--------------------------------------

❌ Using

is_same<T,U>

instead of

is_same<T,U>::value

(or is_same_v<T,U> in C++17).

--------------------------------------

❌ Confusing type transformation traits with type property traits.

--------------------------------------

❌ Using enable_if in the function body instead of the template declaration.

